  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked genmaicha and stir to combine.",
    "Add the dried revithia beans and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let simmer, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the beans are tender.",
    "Stir in the crumbled feta cheese, chopped parsley, lemon juice, and sour cream.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
